OTHER PEOPLE'S WORK

Files by other people keep their own licences. src/json.hpp is JSON for
Modern C++ (MIT, Niels Lohmann, with parts under other licences; see
tools/licenses/JSON-for-Modern-CPP.txt). tools/licenses/ also keeps ENet's
licence. The packaged game lists every library it ships, with its licence and
where its source is, in THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.txt.
